(text "Notes" (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 218.27 194.5 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b0b41ee3-2033-47bc-b6f4-a0d717e0a723"))
(text "1. U1 relay wiring is from the proposed table and Rob's reports; \"?\" colours aren't documented.\n2. R4: \"existing red\" and orange come from the proposed table; check on the wire.\n3. DI2-DI5: Brown CAT5 labels give Green/Brown/Green-White for one valve. Valve 2's colours are unknown.\n4. Valve internals and motor-limit wiring are deliberately not drawn.\n5. Diode D1 stops idle current through the spa's low-resistance output.\n6. Commons go on DGND. With them on COM, DI1-DI5 all read inactive.\n7. R6 + R7 switch together: energized = pool, released = tank. Motor wires are Brown CAT5." (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 219.54 226.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "23a50293-906d-483d-a5ce-546c16822736"))
